        "Description": "The Morgue detail at the Gamma Research Facility in Hokkaido has attracted some unsavory characters. These men like to hang around dead bodies far too much. Smith is even cosplaying as a corpse! It&apos;s creepy and it must not continue. Think of the Children! If these people like the dead so much, they can become the dead.",
